    "stowed_pose": "authored: arms folded against the Spine (the search's constraints: 20 mm clearance to every robot part, hands >= 0.30 m apart, above 0.77 m, a collision-free straight joint-space path to the FR3 ready pose), found by a search over the FR3 limits with MuJoCo's midphase off. As built, the Duo mount puts the stowed shoulders (link1-link3) ~0.31-0.35 m either side of the centre line, wider than the 583 mm TMR, and the Spine mount and shoulders up to ~0.6 m ahead of base_link, ~0.2 m ahead of the TMR's front; not a Franka-published pose",
